    "section": "contributing",
    "html": "<h2>Prerequisites</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bun.sh\">Bun</a> runtime</li>\n<li>Docker (for the local PostgreSQL 16 database)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Local Setup</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Clone the repository and install dependencies:</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/AydenGroup/nitrobase.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nitrobase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bun</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span></code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Create <code>.env.local</code> and generate secrets:</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cp</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env.example</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env.local</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Fill in ENCRYPTION_KEY and SESSION_SECRET (>= 32 chars each):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># openssl rand -hex 32</span></span></code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Start local PostgreSQL</strong> (published on <code>127.0.0.1:5443</code>):</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> postgres</span></span></code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Apply Drizzle database migrations:</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bun</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> db:migrate</span></span></code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Start the development server</strong> (available at <code>http://localhost:3000</code>):</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bun</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span></code></pre>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Common Commands</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Command</th><th align=\"left\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run dev</code></td><td align=\"left\">Start Vite + TanStack Start dev server with HMR</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run build</code></td><td align=\"left\">Production build</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run typecheck</code></td><td align=\"left\">TypeScript type checking (<code>tsc --noEmit</code>)</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run check</code></td><td align=\"left\">Biome lint and format check</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run test</code></td><td align=\"left\">Run Vitest unit and template snapshot tests</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run i18n:extract &#x26;&#x26; bun run i18n:compile</code></td><td align=\"left\">Extract and compile Lingui translation catalogs</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run i18n:check</code></td><td align=\"left\">Verify translation catalog completeness</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run db:generate</code></td><td align=\"left\">Generate a new Drizzle SQL migration from <code>src/db/schema/</code></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>bun run db:migrate</code></td><td align=\"left\">Apply pending migrations</td></tr></tbody></table>"
